Commands

CREATE DATABASE your_database; >Creates a database within SQL 

CREATE TABLE your_table (data columns); >Creates a table within the current database 

INSERT INTO your_database(data types) >Inserts 

VALUES (numberdata,'your_data'), ('more_data');  

 

Data Types 

varchar(amount) >Characters and how many allowed  

date >Must input a date in the format year-month-day 

numeric >Must input a number 



Syntax

SQL must end with a semicolon (;)

